  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Creeps and Curses V.3.1</em></p><p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Harmony</em></p>\n<p>You can bring yourself into Harmony with the world around you. You gain advantage on one attack roll, ability check, or saving throw. Once you do so, you must finish a long rest before you can use this feature again, unless you spend 2 cursed energy to use it again. At 6th level, you can use your reaction and spend 2 cursed energy to roll 1d6 and apply the number rolled as a bonus or penalty (your choice) to the creature's roll. You can do so after the creature rolls but before any effects of the roll occur.</p>",
